; ── try- forms ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; (mg:try-OP ARGS ..) is (mg:OP ARGS ..), except that a refusal, malformed
; input, exhaustion, resource stop, denial or conflict is the value
; (Error CALL (KIND "reason")) rather than a raised error, so search code
; can branch on it.  Evaluator cancellation still interrupts the call.

